sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as MultiScan4D<br/>(Class A device)
    participant P as Scan Pipeline<br/>(black box)
    participant BE as Back-end API<br/>(TS/Express)
    participant FS as Rust File Service<br/>(S3 via AWS SDK)
    participant DB as Per-tenant<br/>MySQL
    participant FE as Portal FE<br/>(Next.js)
    participant U as Clinician

    D->>P: Capture 3D scan + metadata (scan_id, user_id, device_id)
    P->>BE: Deliver processed scan payload
    BE->>FS: Store 3D model (PLY/OBJ/STL) + raw archive
    BE->>DB: Write scan metadata to owning tenant DB
    Note over BE,DB: Device→tenant→user ownership enforced

    U->>FE: Sign in (HTTP-only cookie) + 2FA
    FE->>BE: Subscribe / request scan list (cookie session)
    Note right of BE: WebSocket topic users/{client}/scans/list<br/>(PLANNED — currently REST/mock, APT-439)
    BE->>DB: Query tenant-scoped scans
    BE-->>FE: Scan list (metadata + signed *_url)
    FE-->>U: Render scan list (status, notes indicator)

    U->>FE: Open scan in 3D viewer
    FE->>FS: GET signed model URL
    FS-->>FE: Model file bytes
    Note over FE: three.js render · IndexedDB cache (500MB LRU)
    FE-->>U: Interactive 3D model (orbit/pan/zoom)

    U->>FE: Download / export (format)
    FE->>BE: Request export + consume credit
    BE->>DB: Decrement credit balance
    BE-->>FE: Signed download URL
    FE-->>U: File download
